  m_Name: Carta_CompostagemUrbanaEmLargaEscala
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Compostagem Urbana em Larga Escala
  _titleEn: Large-Scale Urban Composting
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: Restos de comida e poda viram adubo em vez de ir para o aterro, onde
    apodreceriam soltando metano.
  _summaryEn: Food scraps and yard waste become fertilizer instead of going to landfill,
    where they would rot and release methane.
  _realWorld: "San Francisco tornou obrigat\xF3ria em 2009 a separa\xE7\xE3o de recicl\xE1veis
    e de org\xE2nicos para compostagem em casas e empresas."
  _realWorldEn: In 2009 San Francisco made it mandatory for homes and businesses
    to separate recyclables and organic waste for composting.
  _tradeOffs: "Exige separa\xE7\xE3o correta na fonte, coleta pr\xF3pria e p\xE1tios
    de compostagem longe de casas, por causa do cheiro."
  _tradeOffsEn: It requires correct sorting at the source, separate collection and
    composting yards away from homes because of the smell.
  _sources:
  - Label: San Francisco Mandatory Recycling and Composting Ordinance (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Francisco_Mandatory_Recycling_and_Composting_Ordinance
